  "content": "# 森林生物群系维度\n\n森林生物群系维度将森林生物群系作为一个独立的维度添加。通过自定义生物群系源，仅生成森林生物群系及其变种。\n\n![预览](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/63pdCQ3Y/images/fd92ad17a3cabe92cf221e159babc22097413163.jpeg)\n\n## 使用方法\n\n要进入森林生物群系维度，请搭建如下所示的传送门：使用黑曜石框架，顶部两个框架拐角处放置橡木原木，底部两个框架拐角处放置粗泥。\n\n![森林生物群系维度传送门](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d78d4796d44d15390f5069c9569e76fa85167007.png)\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- 基础或库\n  - [生物群系](https://modrinth.com/project/PxfTEarK)\n    - [TerraBlender（BoP、OTWBG、RU 等）](https://modrinth.com/project/AeAYU1UM)\n- [乘客传送门修复](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **机械动力**附属模组：[机械动力：传送门集成](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 问题\n\n目前没有报告新的兼容性问题或漏洞。请在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/issues) 上报告，以便修复。\n\n## 支持版本\n\n🟩 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 支持  \n🟥 停止支持  \n🟨 进行中  \n🟪 考虑中\n\n## 备注\n\n欢迎在整合包、视频、直播或类似媒体中使用。如果您喜欢这个模组，考虑在经济上支持我，我将不胜感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上关注我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上获取\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上观看\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 上交流\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上赞助\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上赞助\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 上赞助\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"维度修复器\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"维度链接\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"世界传送门\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"原版世界\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"更多猫品种\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"乘客传送门修复\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/createportalintegration\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-